            <title>[IGNITE-6863] visorcmd: &apos;cache -a&apos; shows nodes that are not matched by nodeFilter</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6863</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&apos;cache -a&apos; command shows all nodes in the detailed summary, even those, which are not matched by a configured node filter.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please find attached archive with the reproducing example project.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;LOCAL cache also has this issue.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
